  "ruleText": "Ed 1307.08 Robotics Education Development Program Grant Disbursement. Grants will be disbursed as a single payment each year of the grant through the business office of the department of education.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Ed 1300) #12573, eff 7-14-18; ss by #12896, EMERGENCY RULE, eff 10-10-19, EXPIRES: 4-7-20\n\nAPPENDIX",
